## AudienceSharingApi

### List accounts with access to an audience owned by an ad account
## List accounts with access to an audience owned by an ad account
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/audiences/shared/accounts?audienceId={{audienceId}}&accountType={{accountType}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### List accounts with access to an audience owned by a business
## List accounts with access to an audience owned by a business
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/businesses/{{business_id}}/audiences/shared/accounts?audienceId={{audienceId}}&accountType={{accountType}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### List received audiences for a business
## List received audiences for a business
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/businesses/{{business_id}}/audiences?order={{order}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Update audience sharing between ad accounts
## Update audience sharing between ad accounts
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/audiences/ad_accounts/shared
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "audience_id": "<string>",
 "operation_type": "<string>",
 "recipient_account_ids": "<string>"
}


### Update audience sharing from an ad account to businesses
## Update audience sharing from an ad account to businesses
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/audiences/businesses/shared
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "audience_id": "<string>",
 "operation_type": "<string>",
 "recipient_business_ids": "<string>"
}


### Update audience sharing from a business to ad accounts
## Update audience sharing from a business to ad accounts
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/businesses/{{business_id}}/audiences/ad_accounts/shared
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "audience_id": "<string>",
 "operation_type": "<string>",
 "recipient_account_ids": "<string>"
}


### Update audience sharing between businesses
## Update audience sharing between businesses
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/businesses/{{business_id}}/audiences/businesses/shared
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "audience_id": "<string>",
 "operation_type": "<string>",
 "recipient_business_ids": "<string>"
}

